 "about_text": "Matthew Marks Gallery was founded in New York in 1991 and today represents thirty-five artists working across painting, sculpture, photography, and printmaking. The gallery has grown to five exhibition spaces—three in New York and two in Los Angeles—totaling more than 18,000 square feet, and mounts between thirteen and fifteen exhibitions each year, often accompanied by original publications. Its program spans multiple generations of artists and a broad range of media, reflecting a long-standing commitment to both established and younger practitioners.",
